{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"738192073211248691","content":"Duckton is a lighter adventure and more of a role playing game than a mechanical adventure. You will be competing for a massive 5000 gold pot to be split between the survivors. Don't worry, you have three simulacra each to gleefully get smashed as you rat each other out for breaking the rules.","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:33:54.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738192615656390737","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"738192073211248691","content":"@everyone \nRule one. \nHappiness is mandatory. Anyone not happy with their experience must be killed immediately so that a new, better, happier version of you may be given the chance to experience duckton.\n\nRule two. \nIt isn’t fun to talk about the rules. And anyone caught not having fun is evidently unhappy. And as we all know: Happiness is mandatory.\n\nRule three.\nAll hygienic standards must be followed at all times including proper care of the duck uniform. Anyone not wearing a perfectly clean and undamaged duck uniform is in violation, and cannot prove that they are a duck. And as well all know: Ducks are the happiest animal on earth.\n\nRule four. \nDuckton is a capitalist enterprise. Evil goose communists and ganderistic activities must be reported immediately. Anyone not enjoying capitalism is clearly not having fun. And as we all know: sharing is not as fun as winning. \n\nRule five\nFriend Beholder will always tell the truth, is always fair and always good.\n(Sentence redacted due to clearance level)\nAnd as we all know, clean guests are happy guests.","created_at":"2020-07-30T00:34:09.525000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738192678558105621","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
